 CellLabel->"Out[2]= ",ExpressionUUID->"4445ab03-89d3-46d4-808c-f7d2cde9188c"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
A ray is a shortest path that stops only because it must; a walk right round \
a cycle is not a shortest path at all.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"5f8419ba-1f14-46c9-9dbe-377624e47d7c"],

